  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I've been having drifting problems on my controller but I'm able to bypass it pretty well in many games since those havehand based locomotion. However, looking through the settings, I can't seem to find an option for that in vrchat. I've asked others in the game and they don't seem to see it either. Its a pretty major inconvenience to only move diagonally, and I don't really have the time or patience to repair/replace my thumbstick, so I've come here to appeal to an option for hand based locomotion. Its also good for people who are better and moving with their hands rather than their head(And for those who say for me to use my right hand instead, I could but would rather not. Besides, this option could be better in the long term since many games support the switch between head-based and hand-based locomotion).",
